This product fetches data from public U.S. government APIs:
  - USPTO Open Data Portal API (https://api.uspto.gov), U.S. Patent and Trademark Office
  - USPTO Trademark Status & Document Retrieval (TSDR) API (https://tsdrapi.uspto.gov)
Use of those APIs is subject to USPTO's terms; API keys are issued to individuals and
must not be shared ("Do not share it with others": https://data.uspto.gov/apis/getting-started).

Endpoint paths were checked against the official OpenAPI specifications published
at https://data.uspto.gov/swagger.

The response-field dictionary in schema/odp.json and schema/tsdr.json (entries with
ids `<binding>.fields.*`) is generated by scripts/gen-fields.mjs from sample API
responses; each schema file records its sources and file hashes in a `provenance`
block. The Open Data Portal entries are generated from responses captured from the
live API with scripts/capture-samples.mjs. Only field names and non-personal example
values are kept; captured responses are not distributed.

The TSDR entries (schema/tsdr.json) are generated from sample API responses published
in https://github.com/patent-dev/uspto-odp (demo/examples, commit
8b4114dd095fccc126fcf16b4884755f7b14c3b3), which is licensed under the MIT License:

